  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Nellie Kane**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **East Virginia Blues**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **A Robin Built A Nest**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Gotta Travel On**: back after 173 archived shows (797 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-08-03.MilabVM-44Link.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 90 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Mics were in DIN configuration, front of board, dead center, about 30 feet from the stage and 7 feet high [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-08-03.MilabVM-44Link.flac24**: taped by Seth Nochajski & Keith Januszak; transferred by Seth Nochajski; source: Milab VM-44 Links > Naiant Littlebox > Sony PCM-M10 [24/48] [1]. Also: Transfer path: MicroSD card to PC, then CD WAV, then FLAC24, about 0.99 GB [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Sam Berenson: [Cobblestone Live Announces 2019 Lineup: Aqueous, Billy Strings, TAUK, More](https://liveforlivemusic.com/news/cobblestone-live-2019-lineup/) [4]",
